    <id>winbox</id>
    <title>MikroTik WinBox (Portable)</title>
    <version>4.5.20261103</version>
    <authors>MikroTik</authors>
    <owners>qzo</owners>
    <summary>WinBox is a small utility that allows administration of Mikrotik RouterOS using a fast and simple GUI.</summary>
    <description>WinBox is a small utility that allows administration of Mikrotik RouterOS using a fast and simple GUI. It is a native Win32 binary, but can be run on Linux and Mac OSX using Wine.

All WinBox interface functions are as close as possible to Console functions. Some of advanced and system critical configurations are not possible from WinBox, like MAC address change on an interface.

Note: WinBox is obviously freeware, but no details about the license are available either on the application website or in the application itself.</description>
    <projectUrl>http://www.mikrotik.com/download</projectUrl>
    <tags>winbox mikrotik network router routeros administration management</tags>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <iconUrl>https://rawcdn.githack.com/EpicMorg/chocolatey/f8e2efbdaf21a31769957241cd22a714e6d4159a/.github/winbox/icon.png</iconUrl>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/EpicMorg/chocolatey</packageSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>http://wiki.mikrotik.com/wiki/Manual:Winbox</docsUrl>
    <releaseNotes>## WinBox 4.5 - [Changelog](https://forum.mikrotik.com/t/winbox-4-5-released/274230)

### What's new in 4.5 (2026-11-03):

* ui: rewrite combobox to support filtering/suggestions;
* app: ignore QML_DISABLE_DISK_CACHE env variable in case user has set it somehow;
* routeros-api: add support for new ui types;
* table: compact enable/disable/remove/comment buttons when there is no space;
* table: optimize fields where data are retrieved from other table (e.g. DHCP Leases -&gt; Bridge Port);
* table: optimize large ordered list rendering (e.g. Log);
* table: show tools in toolbar as buttons if there is space available;
* ui: add topology support;
* ui: change text selection color in dark mode;
* ui: make input field and table cell text color brighter in dark mode;
* ui: rework bar graphs ui;
* ui: update and add new icons;
* ui: update icons for users tables;
    </releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\*.*" target="tools" exclude="**\*.swp;**\*~;**\*.php" />
  </files>
</package>
